{
    "pageid": 196,
    "title": "North Africa Expansion",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "North Africa Expansion , or simply NAE, is a mod focusing on expanding the existing vanilla map with new content specific to North Africa, an area previously ignored by Paradox in CK2."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Its main features are:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Greatly expanded number of provinces in existing regions of North Africa, as well as new provinces in Central Africa.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Appropriate titles and title histories (when research is available) for the new provinces, as well as new additional titles to existing areas of North Africa.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New Religions & Cultures .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Ethiopians theoretically survive longer.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}